# Permanent public URL for the CV: https://amirpasha.me/cv
# A 200 rewrite (not a 301/302) so the address bar keeps showing /cv
# instead of jumping to the asset path. To publish a new CV, replace
# assets/cv.pdf and commit -- the shared URL never changes.
/cv      /assets/cv.pdf   200
/cv/     /assets/cv.pdf   200
/cv.pdf  /assets/cv.pdf   200
